crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84af25e3b0ade800826a2df90160a1ea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/63c66241/uploads/origins/18ca0f6d-dc50-4c44-9214-cf2c0b3b0bee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dca042e18ba3dc5d4c04106de38a6c71 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Lamy! I like to request a portrait of my friend's character. This is a surprise for her. Her character's name is Morgal.\n\nExpression: A gentle expression + warm smile\n\nPhysical trait:\n-freckles across her face\n\nBackground: simple blue flowers\n\nI leave the rest up to you. Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1085Eby8tCbv3ZhaDtzjxxBQrguj_T4UK?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lamenthyst/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f90ab676/uploads/origins/21a9d43d-8843-4a6f-a2c3-5d33b925fc1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=867a11227af17ae99e4a63499e7b985d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f90ab676/uploads/origins/21a9d43d-8843-4a6f-a2c3-5d33b925fc1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=867a11227af17ae99e4a63499e7b985d, https://si.imgix.net/f90ab676/uploads/origins/21a9d43d-8843-4a6f-a2c3-5d33b925fc1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df79c8811f5342c2da6dc402b0b5b5f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f90ab676/uploads/origins/21a9d43d-8843-4a6f-a2c3-5d33b925fc1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee8ffb1ebee246c69b38c4df951ed484 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!  I really love the romantic era painting quality of your work!  I would love to request a close-up portrait of one of my D&D characters. She is a vampire twilight cleric who feeds on dreams instead of blood. She is the dutchess of a small area in the north in a world where that area is shrouded in eternal darkness.  Her personality is guarded, serious and ambitious.\n\nFeel free to change/simplify her outfit.  Some inspo for her: https://www.pinterest.com/tsunflowerss/elasha/\n\nThank you for the consideration!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/2192723.elasha", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lamenthyst/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/13cb0c08/uploads/origins/86fc07bd-bad2-48cd-b50d-4b5666395583?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b81d912f4f4c2ed870a3bc1751cd95c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/13cb0c08/uploads/origins/86fc07bd-bad2-48cd-b50d-4b5666395583?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b81d912f4f4c2ed870a3bc1751cd95c, https://si.imgix.net/13cb0c08/uploads/origins/86fc07bd-bad2-48cd-b50d-4b5666395583?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f0cdad414a3b0ac3fbe95dae43eb3e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/13cb0c08/uploads/origins/86fc07bd-bad2-48cd-b50d-4b5666395583?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9159d274268c0b5e35459741ac52ab8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, I hope you are well! I like to request my original character in the reference provided. I like to see him drinking tea in an ancient tea shop setting and looking at you with a gentle expression. He has dark blue eyes, a long scar across his right cheek, and please have his hair down (no braid) over his shoulders and back. I leave the rest up to you.\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UwBcSWmMqH0Jq2sf4rk2rIglxQaXMB2y?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lamenthyst/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a102f7a4/uploads/origins/9f719b6a-92e2-4d43-a68b-a20404b21e7c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fb24006b90a6b5158607a64d8738411", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a102f7a4/uploads/origins/9f719b6a-92e2-4d43-a68b-a20404b2